  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mubonereze Abamidia nga mwesasuuza olw'ebyo bye baakola Abaisiraeli. Bw'onaamala okukola ekyo oidha kutwalibwa weeyimbe ku bantu bo abaafa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Musa yaakoba abantu ati: “Mu imwe mwerondemu abantu mubaghe eby'okulwanisa, baje balumbe Abamidia bababonereze nga beesasuuza nga Musengwa Katonda bw'alagiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulonde abantu lukumi (1,000) okuva mu buli kika ky'Abaisiraeli, baje balwane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho baalonda abantu lukumi lukumi okuva mu buli kika, nga bava mu nkumi n'enkumi edh'Abaisiraeli. Abantu abo baaghera omutwalo mulala n'enkumi ibiri (12,000), nga bagemye eby'okulwanisa era nga beetegeike okulwana mu lutalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaabasindika okulwana nga baduumirwa Finehasi mutabane wa Eleazari kabona, eyali n'ebintu ebikozesebwa mu Kifo Ekitukuvu, ghalala n'amagwala agafuuyibwa ng'akamanhiso ak'ebiragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalumba Abamidia nga Musengwa Katonda bweyabalagira ng'abita mu Musa. Baita buli musaadha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baita bakyabazinga abataanu ab'Abamidia, bano: Evi, Rekema, Zuri, Huri ni Reba. Era mu lutalo olwo mwe baitira ni Balaamu mutabane wa Beori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisiraeli baanhaga abakazi n'abaana abato ab'Abamidia, baabatwala nga basibe ghalala n'ente dhaibwe dhoonadhoona, n'entaama n'embuzi n'ebintu byaibwe ebindi byonabyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baayokya ebibuga eby'Abamidia ni weema dhaibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baatoola ebintu byonabyona bye baanhaga, omwali abantu n'ensolo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baabitwalira Musa ni Eleazari kabona, n'Abaisiraeli boonaboona abaali beesoloiza mu kifo ghe baasimba weema dhaibwe, e Yeriko mu kiketezo eky'oku museetwe ogw'e Moabu, okuliiraana n'omwiga Yorudani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musa, ni Eleazari kabona, n'abakulembeze ab'Abaisiraeli, baava mu kifo ghe baasimba weema dhaibwe, baaja okweisuusaayo eigye lya Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaasungughalira abakulu mu igye eryo abaira okuva mu lutalo. Abo n'abaaduumira enkumi n'enkumi era baaduumira ebikumi n'ebikumi eby'abalwani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaababuuza ati: “Lwaki mulese abakazi bano boonaboona nga bakaali balamu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhukire nga baali bakazi abo, mu bizibu ebyali e Peori, nga bajiira ku magezi ga Balaamu, baaleetera Abaisiraeli okughemukira Musengwa Katonda baalekera okuba abeesigwa y'ali. Ekyavaamu n'ekibamba okwidha mu bantu ba Musengwa Katonda abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 25:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mperaano mwite buli mwana mulenzi, era na buli mukazi eyaali abaireku n'omusaadha mu buliri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abaghala abato abakaali kubaaku na basaadha mu buliri, mubaleke nga balamu, mubasigaze nga baimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era buli muntu ku imwe eyaita omuntu, n'oyo eyagema ku mufu, asigale eyo kuliya okw'ekifo ghe twasimba weema dhaife, okumala enaku musanvu. Ku lunaku olwokusatu ni ku lwomusanvu mwidha kwetukuza, imwe aghalala n'abantu be mwanhaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mwidha kutukuza buli kivaalo, na buli kintu kya luwu, n'ebintu byonabyona ebyakolebwa mu buviiri obw'embuzi, era n'ebyo byonabyona ebyakolebwa mu muti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleazari kabona yaakoba abantu abaali baakava mu lutalo okulwana, ati: “Lino n'eiteeka Musengwa Katonda lye yalagira Musa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaabu, feeza, ekyuma eky'ekikomo, ekyuma ekigumu einho, eibaati, ekyuma ekizitogha einho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na buli kintu ekigumira omuliro, mwidha kukibisa mu muliro olw'okukitukuza. Aye era mwidha kukitukuza n'amaadhi ag'okutukuza. Ate buli kintu ekitaghanga kugumira muliro, mwidha kukibisa mu maadhi ago ag'okutukuza gonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muteekwa okwoza ebivaalo byaimwe ku lunaku olwomusanvu, olwo mube abalongoofu. Memale mughange okwidha mu kifo ghe twasimba weema dhaife.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe ni Eleazari kabona, n'abakulu ab'ebikunsu mu Isiraeli, mubale ebintu byonabyona ebyanhagibwa mu lutalo, abantu n'ensolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Memale mubigabaniemu ghabiri, ebindi bibe bya balwani beene abaaja mu lutalo, ate ebindi bibe bya bantu abandi boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mugabo ogw'abalwani beene abaaja mu lutalo, oidha kutoolaku empooza ya Musengwa Katonda nga ya muntu mulala mulala ku buli bantu abanhage ebikumi ebitaanu. Era oidha kukola otyo ku nte, ku ndogoyi, ku ntaama ni ku mbuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Empooza eyo oidha kugitoola ku mugabo gwaibwe, ogighe Eleazari kabona, ebe ekigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mugabo ogw'Abaisiraeli abandi abasigairegho oidha kutoolaku omuntu mulala mulala ku buli bantu ataanu abanhage, era oidha kukola otyo ku nte, ku ndogoyi, ku ntaama, ku mbuzi, era ni ku nsolo edhindi dhoonadhoona, obighe Abalevi abalabirira Weema ya Musengwa Katonda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ni Eleazari kabona n'abakulu baakola nga Musengwa Katonda bweyalagira Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bintu eigye ery'Abaisiraeli bye lyanhaga ku Bamidia ebyasigalagho byali biti: Entaama emitwalo nkaaga na musanvu n'enkumi itaanu (675,000), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ente emitwalo musanvu n'enkumi ibiri (72,000), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "endogoyi emitwalo mukaaga na lukumi (61,000), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abantu emitwalo esatu n'enkumi ibiri (32,000); ng'abo n'abaghala abaali nga tibabangaku na basaadha mu buliri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mu kugabaniamu aghabiri, abalwani abaaja mu lutalo beene, baafuna entaama emitwalo asatu n'esatu na kasanvu na bitaanu (337,500). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo baatoolaku entaama lukaaga na nsanvu na itaanu (675), ng'empooza ye baagha Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ente dhaali emitwalo esatu na kakaaga (36,000), kwe baatoola ente ensanvu n'eibiri ng'empooza ya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endogoyi dhaali emitwalo esatu na bitaanu (30,500), kwe baatoola endogoyi enkaaga n'endala ng'empooza ya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baali omutwalo mulala na kakaaga (16,000), kwe baatoola abantu asatu n'ababiri ng'empooza ya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaatoola empooza eyo eyali ng'ekigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda, yaagigha Eleazari kabona, nga Musengwa Katonda bweyalagira Musa oyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
