      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Musa amaze okwawulaku ebintu eby'abalwani abaaja mu lutalo beene, Abaisiraeli abaasigalagho bye baafuna byali biti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entaama emitwalo amakumi asatu n'esatu na kasanvu na bitaanu (337,500), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ente emitwalo esatu na kakaaga (36,000), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "endogoyi emitwalo esatu na bitaanu (30,500), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abantu omutwalo mulala na kakaaga (16,000). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku mugabo ogwo Abaisiraeli abaasigalagho gwe baafuna, Musa yatoolaku omuntu mulala mulala ku buli bantu amakumi ataanu, era yaatoola n'ensolo ndala ndala ku buli nsolo amakumi ataanu, yaabigha Abalevi abalabirira Eweema ya Musengwa Katonda. Musa ekyo yakikola nga Musengwa Katonda oyo bweyamulagira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abakulu mu igye abaaduumira enkumi n'enkumi edh'abalwani n'ebikumi n'ebikumi eby'abalwani, baidha ye Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baamukoba bati: “Isebo, ife abagheereza bo tubaze abalwani boonaboona be twaduumira nga baligho boonaboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era tuleese ekigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda nga buli muntu bweyafuna. Tuleese ebintu bya zaabu eby'okwewoomya, ebikomo, empeta edh'oku ngalo n'edh'oku matu n'ebinhere, nga tusaba Musengwa Katonda atutooleku ebibi byaife.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ni Eleazari kabona, baabatoolaku ebintu ebyo byonabyona eby'okwewoomya bye baaleeta, ebyakolebwa mu zaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaabu yeenayeena abakulu mu igye abo abaaduumira enkumi n'enkumi edh'abalwani n'ebikumi n'ebikumi eby'abalwani, ye baaghaayo ng'ekigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda, yagheramu kumpi kilo ebikumi bibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abalwani beene abaaja mu lutalo, bale abandi abataali baduumizi, buli muntu yasigaza bye yanhaga ku Bamidia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ni Eleazari kabona, baatwala zaabu oyo ye baatoola ku baduumizi abo ab'abaisirukale enkumi n'enkumi n'ebikumi n'ebikumi, baamuta mu Weema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda, abenga ekiidhukizo eky'Abaisiraeli mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
